{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":971403,\"title\":\"Fabien\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Fabien is a carer in a residence for dependent persons. Among his missions, the young man reads for Mr Verdier, a man who is neither speaking nor walking. One day, while he is reading him poetry, Fabien notices that his auditor's eyes linger on some parts of his body. Under an impulse, he proposes to take him on a walk.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oSUt80cHeUwAYY89j73xUXZw1Zd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/40sysKdqRPW64PsX2wJ6IfE8ItX.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":2021,\"runtime\":10,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Pierre Guiho\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2987424,\"name\":\"Pierre Guiho\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1499738,\"name\":\"Gaëtan Vettier\",\"character\":\"Fabien\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/70jNuGgOQOL3TV9EjhfOQybL2C9.jpg\"},{\"id\":29516,\"name\":\"Serge Renko\",\"character\":\"Monsieur Verdier\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tFZSKMzhC5GzjoO7REUDecxx4Sb.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1422041,\"title\":\"LA BOLA NEGRA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7HwFQTMghL6HOvzEnXYUvyuZXeh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDsmYvrzto7xrEwqDpLC3SPhn9A.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The intertwined lives of three men in three different eras, three lives intimately linked by sexuality and desire, pain, and legacy.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1088548,\"title\":\"Bitter Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a long December holiday weekend, a woman, whose mothe